                + " but found: " + indices);
        }
    }
}

public byte readByte() throws IOException {
    // If the current buffer is exhausted, attempt to refill it
    if (bufPos >= bufLim) {
        int readBytes;
        // Keep trying to fill the buffer until we receive data or hit EOF
        do {
            readBytes = in.read(buffer);
            if (readBytes == -1) {
                // No more data available
                throw new EOFException("End of stream reached while reading a byte");
            }
            // Guard against the unlikely event that read() returns 0
        } while (readBytes == 0);
        bufPos = 0;
        bufLim = readBytes;
    }
    // Return the next byte and advance the buffer position
    return buffer[bufPos++];
}

